OL,3,CInside the multi-million pound world
OL,4,Cof 'crash for cash' scams
OL,6,FNew figures show so-called 'crash for
OL,7,Fcash' scams have cost more than 25
OL,8,Fmillion pounds over the last five
OL,9,Fyears, as ITV News Consumer Editor
OL,10,FChris Choi reports
OL,12,FPolice have exclusively released new
OL,13,Fdashcam footage to ITV News,
OL,14,Fhighlighting a fraud known as "cash
OL,15,Ffor crash".
OL,17,FIt's where criminals deliberately
OL,18,Fstage collisions to claim on your
OL,19,Finsurance.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
