OL,3,CInside the multi-million pound world
OL,4,Cof 'crash for cash' scams
OL,6,FNew figures show the cost of these
OL,7,Fscams now runs into the millions - as
OL,8,Fvillains run into innocent motorists.
OL,10,FKam Patel was targeted by these modern-
OL,11,Fday highway robbers. He told ITV News:
OL,12,F"It was shocking, all I can say is
OL,13,Fit's a shock to the system to know
OL,14,Fyou're a victim of a total staged set
OL,15,Fup.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
