OL,3,CInside the multi-million pound world
OL,4,Cof 'crash for cash' scams
OL,6,F"I guessed that there was something a
OL,7,Flittle bit strange about the whole
OL,8,Fthing.
OL,10,F"I've got this feeling that have I
OL,11,Fhurt somebody, have I injured somebody
OL,12,Fand on the same point, I thought have
OL,13,FI been set up?"
OL,15,FNew data given to ITV News by police
OL,16,Fand insurance sources shows staged
OL,17,Fcrashes amounted to more than #25
OL,18,Fmillion pounds over five years.
