OL,3,CInside the multi-million pound world
OL,4,Cof 'crash for cash' scams
OL,6,FFraud officers are urging drivers to
OL,7,Fbe aware of single parked vans near
OL,8,Fjunctions, as 'crash for cash' moped
OL,9,Friders often use them as hiding spots.
OL,11,FThey also warn to be wary of moped
OL,12,Friders loitering or acting
OL,13,Fsuspiciously in residential areas.
OL,14,FOften, they will hang around in small
OL,15,Froads off busy high streets before
OL,16,Fstaging a collision.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
