OL,3,CInside the multi-million pound world
OL,4,Cof 'crash for cash' scams
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Christopher
OL,7,FO'Donovan said: "The victim has gone
OL,8,Finto them, their insurance will be
OL,9,Fpaying out granted, but yes they'll be
OL,10,Flosing their no claims bonus.
OL,12,F"They themselves might be injured as a
OL,13,Fresult of that, which is the big thing
OL,14,Ffor me, impact upon the victim as I
OL,15,Fcall it, the member of the public.
OL,17,F"Because they're going to be shaken,
OL,18,F(have) trauma, potential whiplash
OL,19,Fthemselves, and who's going to pay for
OL,20,Fthat?"
